<title>USA: Wiser Oil calls Cameron Parish well dry.</title>
<headline>Wiser Oil calls Cameron Parish well dry.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wiser Oil Co said on Friday that it has drilled a prospect in Cameron Parish, La. to 17,500 feet and it was found to be unproductive.</p>
<p>Wiser has no future plans for this prospect, the company said.</p>
<p>Wiser was not immediately available for further comment about the propsect.  </p>
<p>A Wiser Oil spokeswoman said the company's cost in the South Lakeside prospect was $1.5 million and the company will be taking a second quarter charge for dry hole costs.</p>
</text>
